  "production_method": [
    "Keep approved original pixels for recognizability where feasible.",
    "Generate missing face skin, rear hair, covered garment regions, sleeve overlap, complete irises/eye whites, closed lashes, oral interior, rice utensils/arms, blush and tears in the supplied character style.",
    "Affine-register generated components on the 1254-square original canvas, then use deliberate semantic masks/overlaps; all final parts are true RGBA, not rectangular screenshot crops.",
    "Separate reference-derived mood mouth shapes from the supplied expression drawings and register them at the shared mouth pivot.",
    "Keep the source exact-mask experiments and frozen runtime-art subsets separate, with no overwriting of existing app/frozen package images."
  ],
